OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANumber of unnecessary heart
OL,4,Aprocedures could be more than first
OL,5,Athought
OL,6,
OL,7,FAround 670 patients' records have been
OL,8,Fchecked as part of an ongoing review by
OL,9,Fthe Belfast Health Trust into the work
OL,10,Fof a cardiologist who fitted specialist
OL,11,Fheart devices between 2007 and 2023.
OL,13,FIn May, BBC News NI reported that more
OL,14,Fthan 160 patients with advanced heart
OL,15,Fconditions may have undergone
OL,16,Funnecessary procedures.
OL,18,FThe trust apologised and said the
OL,19,Frecall of patients was not ideal, but
OL,20,Fit would reassure those affected that
OL,21,Fthe device was safe and reduce undue
OL,22,Fworry.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
