OL,3,GNEWSANumber of unnecessary heart
OL,4,Aprocedures could be more than first
OL,5,Athought
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt said patients treated by
OL,8,Fcardiologist Dr Ernest Lau do not need
OL,9,Fto take immediate action. Its medical
OL,10,Fdirector apologised for any distress
OL,11,Fcaused and said those impacted would
OL,12,Freceive a letter.
